# REVA.N Core

The REVA.N Core is the conceptual foundation of the REVA.N architecture.

It defines the fundamental structures through which observation, evidence, knowledge, analysis, reasoning, evaluation, and decision support can be connected.

## Core Flow

Observation
→ Evidence
→ Knowledge
→ Analysis
→ Reasoning
→ Evaluation
→ Decision Support

## Purpose

The Core provides a common foundation for REVA.N modules and applications.

It is intended to evolve as the architecture is tested, implemented, and evaluated.

## Current Status

Conceptual and experimental.

The Core is under active research and development.